From 4d678462befa0c8bfa307c056aaf7973e036a744 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: mms-it-ch <info@mms-it.ch>
Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 15:01:14 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 07/32] rtl: z/OS floating point control, signals as
 exceptions, more units

- s390x: FPU control word is the FPC register (traps, flags, rounding);
  SysInitFPU enables the invalid, zero-divide and overflow traps
- z/OS: sigaction goes through FPC_ZOS_SIGACTION (sa_handler and
  sa_sigaction are separate fields); the signal handler redirects the
  machine context to HandleErrorAddrFrame (FPC_ZOS_SIGREDIRECT)
- cwstring, cthreads build for z/OS

Assisted-by: Claude Code (Anthropic)
